Data Attribution and Provider Terms Notice:

The MIT License above applies to the original software, scripts, stylesheets,
and documentation in this repository. Official interest rate data downloaded
and displayed by this project originates from public U.S. government and
Federal Reserve sources and remains subject to each provider's terms of use:

1. U.S. Department of the Treasury — Daily Treasury Par Yield Curve Rates
   - Feed Documentation: https://home.treasury.gov/treasury-daily-interest-rate-xml-feed
   - Data Center: https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/TextView?type=daily_treasury_yield_curve

2. Federal Reserve Bank of New York — EFFR & SOFR Reference Rates
   - Markets Data API Documentation: https://markets.newyorkfed.org/static/docs/markets-api.html
   - Terms of Use for NY Fed Reference Rates & APIs: https://www.newyorkfed.org/markets/data-api-intangibles/terms-of-use
